From 058ea572c423d97b05e62ee14e639df0ecd3b37a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Schiffhauer <Alexander.Schiffhauer@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:07:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] keyboard: Add XKB-backed software input primitives

Expose the configured keymap to software keyboards and deliver validated text through the existing password handlers without raw key-event logging. Add an XKB layout model for modifier state, layout groups and composed UTF-8 input, with tests for US, German and French maps, corrections and prompt retries.
